<div class="region-config standard-form">
    <header class="region-element region-behavior flexrow">
        <div class="region-element-name" style="padding: .25em; padding-bottom: 1em">
        Add Regions to trigger their behaviors from a Terminal
        <span style="opacity: .8"> - Simulate any event (i.e. "Token Enters") for any Region</span>
        <button type="button" data-action="showTips" style="margin-top: 1em; width: 100%">How does this work?</button>
        <div style="display: none; margin-top: 1em" class="terminal-region-tips">
            <ul style="margin: 0">
                <li>To trigger a Macro behavior, the triggering player will need at least <b>Observer</b> permission on the macro</li>
                <li>When requiring a skill check, behaviors get ran on the GM side</li>
                <li>You can add Regions from other scenes 😎</li>
                <li>Token events (i.e. "Token Move") require at least 1 token present on the scene viewed by the triggering player (it doesn't matter what token)</li>
                <li>To trigger a teleport token behavior, use the "tokenMoveIn" event</li>
                <ul>
                    <li>This requires a <b>single owned</b> token from the triggering player present on the scene</li>
                    <li>Forces the behaviors to be ran on the GM side</li>
                </ul>
            </ul>
        </div>
        </div>
    </header>
    <div class="standard-form">

      <button type="button" data-action="addRegion">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-location-crosshairs"></i> Add Region Trigger
      </button>

      {{#unless noRegion}}
        <fieldset style="margin-top: 1em">
            <legend>Region Triggers</legend>

            {{#each regions}}
              <div uuid="{{this.uuid}}" style="display: grid; gap: .4em">
                {{#unless (eq @index 0)}}
                  <hr/>
                {{/unless}}

                <div>
                  <span class="hint" data-tooltip="{{this.uuid}}">{{this.prettyContext}}</span>
                  <button style="width: 40px; float: right" type="button" class="icon fa-regular fa-trash-alt" data-tooltip="Remove Region Trigger" data-action="removeRegion" id="{{this.uuid}}" />
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                  <label>Simulated Event</label>
                  <div class="form-fields">
                    <select name="event">
                      {{#each ../events}}

                        {{#if (eq ../this.event this)}}
                          <option value="{{this}}" selected>{{this}}</option>
                        {{else}}
                          <option value="{{this}}">{{this}}</option>
                        {{/if}}

                      {{/each}}
                    </select>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                  <label>Button Name</label>
                  <div class="form-fields">
                    <input type="text" name="btnName" value="{{this.btnName}}" />
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            {{/each}}
        </fieldset>
        {{/unless}}
    <div>
</div>
